            <div xml:id="m-ef271cf8-be1f-4af4-ae8a-246165ac0d05">
              <lg xml:id="m-1c6898f0-ad17-49f6-a36f-0c6c09cd8460">
                <l xml:id="m-05ccf7ca-c4d2-4bf1-9b7b-6b7e54c760f2" facs="#m-a1d8d14d-1831-4025-b5fa-af3f0cfe646b" label="ambiguous">nez</l><l xml:id="m-31dccdde-0cad-465d-bde3-c5d1ba578e17" facs="#m-6f12209c-bdee-4b8a-a1d7-ac22f294f458" label="text-like">Common of Two or More Martyrs. Mass I.</l><l xml:id="m-5f2d1c86-a550-4728-a088-37530a90e0bb" facs="#m-ef7288df-56aa-4abb-ba60-dd89a0a558ac" label="text-like">I. MASS OF TWO OR MORE MARTYRS.</l><l xml:id="m-3de02d35-4649-4038-906a-90cbc323a4ad" facs="#m-5df70ce8-7720-4f61-b6ed-862d2f254d46" label="text-like">OUT OF PASCHAL TIME</l><l xml:id="m-4b17b70a-f855-4689-aa74-60cd0791fecb" facs="#m-02b0ab0f-9aa5-462f-82a5-a5bbeb105baf" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-71927610-ca9d-4a3c-b83f-0d6ecc255cd9" facs="#m-d2d3b9c2-d1f9-4509-b3b7-b3f69a440925" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-0eff8325-ab52-46cc-82e1-28ddf8dce14a" facs="#m-94042751-d42d-45ca-99b8-6f7cc0100017" label="lyrics-like">*in conspéctu tú¬ D6́-mine, gé¬</l><l xml:id="m-ae526292-9184-44af-8d5f-af03c155e5f7" facs="#m-3cc5ed2f-f35b-44a0-b17e-a1707bc3bc2b" label="ambiguous">Ntret</l><l xml:id="m-d6abc22c-3faf-41dd-a9bd-3fed3d9e6711" facs="#m-3e671b38-97ec-401e-8d5b-30a21f7d20df" label="lyrics-like">mi-tus compedi-tó- rum, rédde vi-cínis nóstris sé-ptu¬</l><l xml:id="m-f8d021a1-d3b4-45a6-881e-4e7fdbb4b728" facs="#m-6df1a545-698b-43b0-9a84-fc99e3f8d06e" label="lyrics-like">plum in sí- nu e- 6- rum: víndi-ca sánguinem san¬</l><l xml:id="m-1f146eb9-ac3b-4bf9-aaf4-1ae5933add94" facs="#m-e46b2553-c2ce-4af3-b0db-e8de74a223f8" label="lyrics-like">ctó- rum tu-ó- rum, qui effú¬ sus est. Ps. Dé- us ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-89e5a236-5d94-4760-b2e8-02fbc03dc844" facs="#m-b7102a33-d60e-4e51-b333-d61c3d00b4ae" label="lyrics-like">nérunt géntes in haere-di-tá-tem tú-am, “pollu-érunt tém¬</l><l xml:id="m-a56eadda-a979-4737-b1d5-e8d252436c94" facs="#m-2088a0c9-d778-4abd-a969-eaabee7db33a" label="lyrics-like">plum sánctum tú-um: posu-érunt Jerúsa-lem in pomórum</l><l xml:id="m-bd285a30-60e9-46c7-99bb-f2c8a2e0b7f6" facs="#m-118aa33f-495a-4a21-998d-d4cb7d9d59b0" label="lyrics-like">custódi-am. Gló-ri-a Pátri. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-1fcce5ce-c302-4f47-92b4-87beafe0b899" facs="#m-f999e2a1-c328-4b2f-82b6-0e97c5355694" label="text-like">For Martyr-Bishops. Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-a0a6b853-1809-48b4-a65f-7531c37a30ef" facs="#m-8a58bd20-67fb-4626-9d7d-803e22370628" label="lyrics-like">2Eatórum Mártyrum paritérque) et eórum comméndet orátio vene¬</l><l xml:id="m-76851b2b-b21a-4dbd-bba1-11a4fb65fee5" facs="#m-137bb98f-eb07-41f5-b0ab-0381c416fe0d" label="lyrics-like">D Pontificum N. et N. nos, quaé- ránda. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-03ba20ae-7b62-4ece-ad89-bca746bf1754" facs="#m-ff877cc0-bc45-45e6-8597-52c63e4850fc" label="lyrics-like">sumus Dómine, festa tueántur:</l><l xml:id="m-9e18cf26-4770-4220-840f-a2e4b21c0680" facs="#m-b25b3f35-2a36-4af4-a384-ac254669ddec" label="text-like">For Martyrs, not Bishops, the Collect, Secret and Postcommunion are</l><l xml:id="m-aba21f36-8ff5-42ea-abb5-c64c046ae715" facs="#m-d4107bb8-0637-42bc-8281-4780b9b7638a" label="text-like">taken from the following Mass. p. 1166.</l><l xml:id="m-1ca40297-7d69-48ba-8804-701cbee4f5cd" facs="#m-fee62b92-1c13-48f7-8a36-69feb0512483" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Sapientiae. Sap. 3.</l><l xml:id="m-9df3e733-c48c-4f13-9fa5-51ee9ce88054" facs="#m-ef8496f5-6538-4856-9626-f83b8ad297eb" label="lyrics-like">IUstórum ánimae in manu Dei  afflictio éxitus illórum : et quod a</l><l xml:id="m-9282aad3-def2-42ba-8705-ed884dfecd4b" facs="#m-747bba52-e141-41d7-98ee-f43f87264b9a" label="ambiguous">Clsunt, et non tanget illos tor¬</l><l xml:id="m-bab3bd80-fdc3-4af6-b664-70c1539c327a" facs="#m-019b5132-e671-45e1-9311-69a49e9900ca" label="lyrics-like">nobis est iter, extermínium: illi</l><l xml:id="m-19736587-4f1c-4e15-a065-1ffb8a1af157" facs="#m-986d8569-49ad-42b1-a36c-1ca39ba74a79" label="lyrics-like">méntum mortis. Visi sunt óculis</l><l xml:id="m-a9db6606-b37b-437c-8fa2-627451c22d65" facs="#m-14097055-d513-451a-b30c-0e48f1190df4" label="ambiguous">autem sunt in pace. Et si coram</l><l xml:id="m-f2a54262-e22f-40ef-84a2-44fb14369eda" facs="#m-e2fab208-095c-4f87-9464-8bf4c3ae4963" label="lyrics-like">insipiéntium mori: et aestimáta est l homínibus torménta passi sunt, spes</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
